    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65689" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μείγνυμι</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίγνυμι</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ&lt;ε&gt;<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίγνυσι</span></span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Pl.
			<u>Lg.</u>
			691e
		</span></i>; imper. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ&lt;ε&gt;<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίγνυ</span></span>
