			Id.
			<u>Phlb.</u>
			63e
		</span></i>:—also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ&lt;ε&gt;<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιγνύω</span></span>, <i><span class="en">
			Damox.
			2.60
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
