		<i><span class="en">
			Archil.
			86
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>I.</u>
			7(6).25
		</span></i>, etc.; inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ&lt;ε&gt;<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῖξαι</span></span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Il.
			15.510
		</span></i>: pf.
