			Plb.
			16.10.1
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			38.13.5
		</span></i>: plpf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμεμίχειν <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>
		</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συν</span>-) <i><span class="en">
			D.C.
			47.45
		</span></i>:—
			Med.
		 and 
			Pass.
		, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ&lt;ε&gt;ίγνυμαι</span></b> 
